      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIERY WORDS (3) is rarely out of the finish, recording 12 places from 22 starts. Has hit the frame at her last three runs, the latest finishing third (24.30) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Top prospect. HIGH PRAYER (6) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.23) at this track behind Farmor Senior in a Grade 5. Got the money at her only try from this box. Expected to feature. JIMMY JAMS (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by one length at Q Lakeside in a handy 25.49 beating Big Grin. Has a low draw and goes well at this distance. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. EMERGENCY MAN (1) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
